Journal #68 (actor `owner-via-orchestrator`), explicit owner approval of 2026-09-28:

- download SmolLM2 (smallest) and Gemma 3 270M; fine-tune on formalizer-v1 once the data rebuild is final, in the order SmolLM2 → Gemma 3 270M; Qwen3-0.6B only if the smaller models are not good enough;
- goal: a scientific comparison of how small the formalizer can be, with CPU speed measured;
- semantic review for this experiment is satisfied by the independent automated auditor (experiment-grade, no human review);
- preregistration (DS010, `status/experiments.json`) and a dry run precede any optimizer step; a single GPU worker per machine.

